{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46229","headline":"游金华山禅院 · 贯休","name":"游金华山禅院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兹地曾栖菩萨僧，旃檀楼殿瀑崩腾。\n因知境胜终难到，问着人来悉不曾。\n斜谷暗藏千载雪，薄岚常翳一龛灯。\n多慙不及当时海，又下嵯峨一万层。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}